  <h2>Non-Monetary Support (Free &amp; Invaluable!)</h2>
  <p>Your time and engagement are just as valuable as financial support. Here are meaningful ways to help that don't cost money:</p>

  <h3>1. Share Our Work</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li>Repost essays and portfolio pieces; link to berryhouse.ca</li>
    <li>Recommend our <a href="/portfolio/">themes and tools</a> to friends, colleagues, or your development community</li>
    <li>Write about your experience using our tools</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Star or Contribute</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-star fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Star one of <a href="https://github.com/brennanbrown" target="_blank" rel="noopener">our repositories</a> on GitHub</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-bug fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Open issues for bugs or feature requests</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-code-pull-request fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Submit pull requests to improve our projects</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Help with documentation by correcting typos or adding examples</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Refer a Client</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li>Introduce us to a nonprofit, collective, or indie creator</li>
    <li>Recommend <a href="/services/">our services</a> to organizations needing web development help</li>
    <li>Connect us with projects aligned with our values</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>4. Join the Community</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li>Join <a href="https://discord.gg/4qdJecDNkt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">our Discord server</a></li>
    <li>Subscribe to the free tier of our <a href="https://patreon.com/brennankbrown" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patreon</a></li>
    <li>Attend a <a href="https://writeclub.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Write Club</a> meeting (if you're in Calgary)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>5. Collaborate</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li>Propose a small, values-aligned project or workshop</li>
    <li>Invite us to guest post on your blog or appear on your podcast</li>
    <li>Offer a testimonial—a few lines about our work help immensely</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>6. Speaking Opportunities</h3>
  <p>Brennan is available for talks on:</p>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li>The IndieWeb and decentralized web technologies</li>
    <li>Indigenous issues in tech</li>
    <li>The craft of writing</li>
    <li>Independent creator economics</li>
    <li>Open-source development</li>
  </ul>
  <p><em>(Virtual talks preferred, but open to Calgary-based in-person events.)</em></p>

  <h3>7. Feedback &amp; Engagement</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-comment fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Comment on blog posts and share your thoughts</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email us</a> with feedback, accessibility notes, or ideas</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Suggest ideas for future content</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>8. Stay Connected</h3>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-rss fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Subscribe via <a href="/feed.xml">RSS</a> to the blog</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open-text fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Join the newsletter and share it with a friend</li>
    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-users fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i> Follow us on social platforms</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why Support Matters</h2>
  <p>When you support independent creators, you're:</p>
  <ul class="space-y-2">
    <li>Building an internet that doesn't rely on surveillance capitalism</li>
    <li>Valuing quality over quarterly earnings</li>
    <li>Helping small creators compete with big tech platforms</li>
    <li>Supporting work that isn't driven by shareholder demands</li>
    <li>Participating in an economy of care and connection</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Every share, star, comment, or contribution helps create a sustainable alternative to the enshittifying platforms that dominate our digital lives.</p>

  <hr>

  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-8">
    Every contribution, monetary or otherwise, helps us sustain accessible community work and open‑source projects. Thank you for support, no matter what it looks like. <i class="fa-solid fa-hands-praying" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  </p>
</div>
